WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.800
Overdue invoices don't chase themselves.

00:04.800 --> 00:09.800
They slip while you are doing the work that actually pays. Reminders sent: zero.

00:10.000 --> 00:15.500
One workflow. Three tones.

00:15.500 --> 00:21.800
Tone is computed in code: friendly under 14 days, firm to 30, solution-oriented after. The reminder sends itself, signed and tracked.

00:22.000 --> 00:26.000
It sends itself. Then it pings you.

00:26.000 --> 00:29.500
The follow-up date is written back to the sheet, and #invoices names the client, the invoice and the amount.
